        <mxCell id="repair" value="&lt;b&gt;8 · Mitigation + Retry Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Build repair prompt from failure evidence&lt;br&gt;Ollama produces repaired code + metadata&lt;br&gt;Bound retries / stop repeated code hashes&lt;br&gt;Re-run claims → static checks → policy&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#F59E0B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
