        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence is retained for every attempt; repaired code receives the same verification checks as the initial output.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;CoVe supports every decision. Semantic evidence and partial catalogs do not establish guaranteed runtime correctness.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;spacing=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
